#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/displays_page.py:421
msgid "Flashes the panel again on each new song (at most every 25 seconds): it restarts for about 17 seconds each time and its memory wears with use. Off: time, progress, volume, play/pause and the spectrum stay live without the song details."
